# Concatenated Amino Acid Sequences & Functional Annotations

This directory contains compressed archives of the concatenated protein coding sequences (ORFs) and consensus functional annotations across the metagenome-assembled genomes (MAGs) analyzed in this study.

---

## Directory Contents

* **`concatenated_amino_acid_sequences.zip`**: Compressed FASTA archive containing predicted amino acid sequences (open reading frames) for all functional genes extracted across MAGs assembled in this study
* **`concatenated_function_annotation.zip`**: Compressed tab-delimited archive containing consensus multi-database functional annotation results (e.g., Bakta, METABOLIC, KEGG, Pfam, EC numbers).

---

## Usage Notes

Unzip the archives using any standard compression utility or command-line tool:

```bash
unzip concatenated_amino_acid_sequences.zip
unzip concatenated_function_annotation.zip
